 most direct path to prepare for university math courses. The course starts with fraction arithmetic and covers all the way up through the algebra of linear equations. Upon completing the course, students will be prepared for Mathematical Foundations II, the second step of the journey towards university-level math." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1009 "Solidify your arithmetic, learn about variables and graphs, level up your algebra, and learn the essentials of geometry." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1012 113 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1013 "MF1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046648 #edb/ref 1014 #uuid "042e624c-a46d-509f-a48e-61bd6d3e082c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048207 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048546 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048207 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050421 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048207 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186179812 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048207 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186179813 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048207 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186179814 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048207 #edb/ref 1031 "Subtracting a Positive Decimal From a Smaller Decimal" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048207 #edb/ref 1033 3680 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048207 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "886ced30-c0cc-548f-90c0-8a84697856ec" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048639 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048546 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048639 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050421 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048639 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186179697 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048639 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186179698 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048639 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186179699 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048639 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186179700 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048639 #edb/ref 1031 "Subtracting a Positive Fraction From a Smaller Fraction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592